# Link patterns lychee skips (regex). Read by the pre-commit hook and external-link-check.yml.

# The security policy's advisory-form link is a GitHub-web route, not a file on disk,
# so offline resolution turns it into a file:// path that cannot exist. Anchored to that
# resolution only, so the absolute https form stays checked.
^file://.*/security/advisories/new$
